/**
 * Theme Options: Appearance → Theme Options.
 *
 * One option holds every setting as [tab][section][field]. This class owns the
 * schema, validation, the admin page (tabs, live preview, import/export) and
 * value lookup. WPM_Styles and WPM_Frontend turn the values into output.
 *
 * Generated by DEVOUR.
 */

